    "Adjusts training plan": {},
    "After each set, Finn guesses the exercise from your joint angles: which joint bends, how far, and how your torso is tilted. If the guess isn’t clear, Finn uses the exercise you chose.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each set, Finn guesses the exercise from your joint angles: which joint bends, how far, and how your torso is tilted. If the guess isn’t clear, Finn uses the exercise you chose."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each set, Finn guesses the exercise from your joint angles: which joint bends, how far, and how your torso is tilted. If the guess isn’t clear, Finn uses the exercise you chose."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de cada serie, Finn adivina el ejercicio según tus ángulos articulares: cuál se dobla, cuánto y cómo está inclinado tu torso. Si no está claro, Finn usa el ejercicio que elegiste."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après chaque série, Finn devine l’exercice d’après les angles de tes articulations : laquelle se plie, de combien, et l’inclinaison de ton buste. Si ce n’est pas clair, Finn garde l’exercice que tu as choisi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each set, an on-device model trained by the Finn team guesses the exercise from your pose points. If it isn’t confident, Finn uses the exercise you chose. Its accuracy is still being tested.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each set, an on-device model trained by the Finn team guesses the exercise from your pose points. If it isn’t confident, Finn uses the exercise you chose. Its accuracy is still being tested."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each set, an on-device model trained by the Finn team guesses the exercise from your pose points. If it isn’t confident, Finn uses the exercise you chose. Its accuracy is still being tested."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de cada serie, un modelo entrenado por el equipo de Finn y ejecutado en el dispositivo adivina el ejercicio según tus puntos de postura. Si no está seguro, Finn usa el ejercicio que elegiste. Su precisión aún se está probando."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après chaque série, un modèle entraîné par l’équipe Finn, qui tourne sur l’appareil, devine l’exercice d’après tes points de pose. S’il n’est pas sûr, Finn garde l’exercice que tu as choisi. Sa fiabilité est encore en test."
          }
        }
      }
    },
