    "Elbow bend is how much your elbow angle closed from the starting position, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elbow bend is how much your elbow angle closed from the starting position, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view."
