    "If you turn on Save workouts to Apple Fitness, Finn writes each finished session to Health as a workout, with your permission: its time, sets, measured reps, and exercise names.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you turn on Save workouts to Apple Fitness, Finn writes each finished session to Health as a workout, with your permission: its time, sets, measured reps, and exercise names."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you turn on Save workouts to Apple Fitness, Finn writes each finished session to Health as a workout, with your permission: its time, sets, measured reps, and exercise names."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si activas Guardar sesiones en Apple Fitness, Finn escribe cada sesión terminada en Salud como un entrenamiento, con tu permiso: su duración, sus series, sus repeticiones medidas y los nombres de los ejercicios."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si tu actives Enregistrer les séances dans Forme, Finn écrit chaque séance terminée dans Santé comme un entraînement, avec ton autorisation : sa durée, ses séries, ses répétitions mesurées et le nom des exercices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
