    "Knee bend is how much the knee angle on the side facing the camera closed from the starting position. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view and front leg.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Knee bend is how much the knee angle on the side facing the camera closed from the starting position. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view and front leg."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Knee bend is how much the knee angle on the side facing the camera closed from the starting position. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view and front leg."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La flexión de rodilla indica cuánto se ha cerrado el ángulo de la rodilla del lado que mira a la cámara desde la posición inicial. Úsalo solo para comparar tus propias series grabadas desde el mismo ángulo y con la misma pierna delante."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La flexion du genou indique de combien l’angle du genou côté caméra s’est fermé depuis la position de départ. Sers-t’en seulement pour comparer tes propres séries filmées sous le même angle, avec la même jambe devant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
