    "On supported iPhones, Apple's on-device model can explain a measured comparison. The camera video is never given to the model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On supported iPhones, Apple's on-device model can explain a measured comparison. The camera video is never given to the model."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On supported iPhones, Apple's on-device model can explain a measured comparison. The camera video is never given to the model."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En los iPhone compatibles, el modelo de Apple integrado en el dispositivo puede explicar una comparación medida. El vídeo de la cámara nunca se entrega al modelo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur les iPhone compatibles, avec Finn en anglais, le modèle d’Apple qui tourne sur l’appareil peut reformuler une comparaison mesurée. La vidéo de la caméra n’est jamais transmise au modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On supported iPhones, Finn estimates your body’s 3D position to tell a side view from a front or angled one. When you are a little turned, it suggests turning and still counts your reps. It only refuses a set when you clearly face the camera, or face away, for several seconds. If it asks you to turn while your side already faces the camera, switch this off.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On supported iPhones, Finn estimates your body’s 3D position to tell a side view from a front or angled one. When you are a little turned, it suggests turning and still counts your reps. It only refuses a set when you clearly face the camera, or face away, for several seconds. If it asks you to turn while your side already faces the camera, switch this off."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On supported iPhones, Finn estimates your body’s 3D position to tell a side view from a front or angled one. When you are a little turned, it suggests turning and still counts your reps. It only refuses a set when you clearly face the camera, or face away, for several seconds. If it asks you to turn while your side already faces the camera, switch this off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En los iPhone compatibles, Finn estima la posición 3D de tu cuerpo para distinguir una vista lateral de una frontal o en ángulo. Si estás un poco girado, te sugiere girar y sigue contando tus repeticiones. Solo rechaza una serie si miras claramente a la cámara o le das la espalda durante varios segundos. Si te pide que gires cuando ya estás de perfil, desactiva esto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur les iPhone compatibles, Finn estime la position de ton corps en 3D pour distinguer une vue de profil d’une vue de face ou de biais. Si ton corps est un peu tourné, il te suggère de pivoter et compte quand même tes répétitions. Il ne refuse une série que si tu fais clairement face à la caméra, ou que tu lui tournes le dos, pendant plusieurs secondes. S’il te demande de tourner alors que tu es déjà de profil, désactive cette option."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On supported iPhones, Finn estimates your body’s 3D position to tell a side view from a front or angled one. When you are a little turned, it suggests turning and still counts your reps. When you clearly face the camera, or face away, it still counts your reps but gives no posture advice. If it asks you to turn while your side already faces the camera, switch this off.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On supported iPhones, Finn estimates your body’s 3D position to tell a side view from a front or angled one. When you are a little turned, it suggests turning and still counts your reps. When you clearly face the camera, or face away, it still counts your reps but gives no posture advice. If it asks you to turn while your side already faces the camera, switch this off."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On supported iPhones, Finn estimates your body’s 3D position to tell a side view from a front or angled one. When you are a little turned, it suggests turning and still counts your reps. When you clearly face the camera, or face away, it still counts your reps but gives no posture advice. If it asks you to turn while your side already faces the camera, switch this off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En los iPhone compatibles, Finn estima la posición 3D de tu cuerpo para distinguir una vista lateral de una frontal o en ángulo. Si estás un poco girado, te sugiere girar y sigue contando tus repeticiones. Si miras claramente a la cámara o le das la espalda, sigue contando tus repeticiones pero no da consejos de postura. Si te pide que gires cuando ya estás de perfil, desactiva esta opción."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur les iPhone compatibles, Finn estime la position de ton corps en 3D pour distinguer une vue de profil d’une vue de face ou en biais. Si tu es un peu tourné, il te suggère de te tourner et compte quand même tes répétitions. Si tu fais clairement face à la caméra, ou si tu lui tournes le dos, il compte tes répétitions mais ne donne aucun conseil de posture. S’il te demande de te tourner alors que tu es déjà de profil, désactive ce réglage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the floor or a low step, a few steps away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
