    "Pull height is how far your shoulders rose from the hang, as a share of your arm length, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull height is how far your shoulders rose from the hang, as a share of your arm length, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull height is how far your shoulders rose from the hang, as a share of your arm length, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La altura de la dominada indica cuánto subieron tus hombros desde la colgadura, como porcentaje de la longitud de tu brazo, según ve la cámara. Úsalo solo para comparar tus propias series grabadas desde el mismo ángulo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La hauteur de traction indique de combien tes épaules sont montées depuis la suspension, en part de la longueur de ton bras, vue par la caméra. Sers-t’en seulement pour comparer tes propres séries filmées sous le même angle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
