    "Rise is how far your shoulders went up from the hang, as a share of your arm length, as seen by the camera. Above 100% your shoulders are above your hands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rise is how far your shoulders went up from the hang, as a share of your arm length, as seen by the camera. Above 100% your shoulders are above your hands."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rise is how far your shoulders went up from the hang, as a share of your arm length, as seen by the camera. Above 100% your shoulders are above your hands."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La subida indica cuánto subieron tus hombros desde la colgadura, como porcentaje de la longitud de tu brazo, según ve la cámara. Por encima del 100 %, tus hombros están por encima de tus manos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La montée indique de combien tes épaules se sont élevées depuis la suspension, en part de la longueur de ton bras, vue par la caméra. Au-delà de 100 %, tes épaules sont au-dessus de tes mains."
          }
        }
      }
    },
