    "Unless you turn it off in Options, Finn reads pose points after a set to recognize the exercise from your joint angles. Pose points and video stay on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unless you turn it off in Options, Finn reads pose points after a set to recognise the exercise from your joint angles. Pose points and video stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unless you turn it off in Options, Finn reads pose points after a set to recognize the exercise from your joint angles. Pose points and video stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A menos que la apagues en Opciones, Finn lee los puntos de pose después de una serie para reconocer el ejercicio según tus ángulos articulares. Los puntos de pose y el vídeo se quedan en este iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sauf si tu la coupes dans Options, Finn lit les points de pose après une série pour reconnaître l’exercice d’après les angles de tes articulations. Les points de pose et la vidéo restent sur cet iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
